.el .ds Aq '
.TH ferry-history 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-history \- Show finished transfers, newest first, or search them
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry history\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-kind\fR] [\fB\-\-clear\fR] [\fB\-\-send\-again\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIQUERY\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show finished transfers, newest first, or search them
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 30]
How many transfers to show
.TP
\fB\-\-kind\fR \fI<KIND>\fR
Show only texts and links (never their content), or only files
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
files: Files and folders only
.IP \(bu 2
texts: Texts and links only
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-clear\fR
Delete the history
.TP
\fB\-\-send\-again\fR \fI<N>\fR
Send the file of transfer N of the list (as numbered) again to the same Ferry device
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fIQUERY\fR]
Show only transfers whose file name, device or detail contains this text
